{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19602","headline":"观庆云图 · 李程","name":"观庆云图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五云从表瑞，藻绘宛成图。\n柯叶何时改，丹青此不渝。\n非烟色尚丽，似盖状应殊。\n渥彩看犹在，轻阴望已无。\n方将遇翠幄，那羡起苍梧。\n欲识从龙处，今逢圣合符。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李程","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}